                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.075,
            0.48,
            0.304,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "his work on chromosomes. As a botanist, he is known for his work in the area of plant taxonomy, evolution and development. He also invented many useful lab methods to study chromosomes in plants. For his contributions to botany, he received many honours, including the Shanti Swarup Bhatnagar award and Padma Bhushan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
